1. FUNCTIONAL EXTENSIONALITY
------------------------------------------------------------
- Equality of functions is EXTENSIONAL:
      f = g  <=>  ∀x. f(x) = g(x)
- Built directly into PVS logic.
- Makes reasoning about higher‑order functions natural.

2. PRIMITIVE TUPLES
------------------------------------------------------------
- Tuples are FIRST-CLASS:
      [a, b, c]
- True product types, not encoded records.
- Integrates cleanly with dependent types & subtypes.

3. PARTIAL FUNCTIONS
------------------------------------------------------------
- Partiality handled via:
      • Subtypes
      • Dependent types
      • TCCs (Type‑Correctness Conditions)
- PVS forces proof obligations whenever domain constraints
  must be shown.

4. STRONG AUTOMATION
------------------------------------------------------------
- Built‑in decision procedures:
      • Equality
      • Linear arithmetic
      • BDD-based propositional simplification
      • Symbolic model checking
- Automatically discharges most TCCs.
- Industrial‑strength automation.

6. RELATIONSHIPS
------------------------------------------------------------
- Extensionality + tuples → clean modeling of structures.
- Partial functions + dependent types → safe specifications.
- Automation → PVS handles the grunt work.
